{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IMediaDataCenter/IVideoStreamManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>IVideoStreamManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@Deprecated</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"> <span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">IVideoStreamManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><a href=\"IMediaDataCenter.html\">IMediaDataCenter</a><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">IVideoStreamManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow ifm-overview-deprecated\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-deprecated-badge\">已废弃</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title ifm-overview-deprecated\">IVideoStreamManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead ifm-overview-deprecated\">码流管理类。用于管理码流通道设置和码流数据获取和渲染等功能。以下是接口使用流程：</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line ifm-overview-deprecated\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.interfaces\" aria-label=\"复制包名\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"描述：\" style=\"display: none;\">描述：</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">码流管理类。用于管理码流通道设置和码流数据获取和渲染等功能。以下是接口使用流程： <br></font></p><li><font color=\"#666\">1. 调用<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager.html#ivideostreammanager_getavailablestreamsources\">getAvailableStreamSources</a></code>获取可用的码流源。</font></li><font color=\"#666\"> <li>2. 调用<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager.html#ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannels\">getAvailableVideoChannels</a></code>获取可用的码流通道。</li> <li>3. 调用<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager.html#ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannels\">getAvailableVideoChannels</a></code>中的<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel_startchannel\">startChannel</a></code>设置步骤1获取到的<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_StreamSource.html#ivideostreammanager_streamsource\">StreamSource</a></code>把码流源和码流通道进行绑定，并且开启当前码流通道。</li> <li>4. 如果你希望自己实现解码功能，你通过添加调用<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel_addstreamdatalistener\">addStreamDataListener</a></code>添加码流数据监听器来接收码流数据。</li> <li>5. 如果你不希望自己实现解码功能，你也可以使用DJI提供的解码器<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoDecoder.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideodecoder\">IVideoDecoder</a></code>来进行解码。</li> <br><b>注意：<br> 该接口从MSDK 5.8.0版本开始废弃。请使用<code><a href=\"ICameraStreamManager.html#icamerastreammanager\">ICameraStreamManager</a></code>来实现码流管理相关功能。</b> <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.0.0开始支持</i></code><p></p>\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>成员</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">11</span> 个成员</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"按名称、参数或描述筛选\" aria-label=\"筛选成员\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"清空搜索\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"listener\">监听</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">方法</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"class\">Class</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"listener\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>监听</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">2</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_addstreamsourceslistener_inline\" data-category=\"listener\" data-search=\"addstreamsourceslistener 设置码流源监听器。通过此监听器可以监听获取新增的码流源。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">addStreamSourcesListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">设置码流源监听器。通过此监听器可以监听获取新增的码流源。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_removestreamsourceslistener_inline\" data-category=\"listener\" data-search=\"removestreamsourceslistener 删除码流源监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">removeStreamSourcesListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">删除码流源监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>方法</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">4</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablestreamsources_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getavailablestreamsources 获取当前所有可用的码流源streamsource列表。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getAvailableStreamSources</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取当前所有可用的码流源StreamSource列表。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_clearallstreamsourceslisteners_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"clearallstreamsourceslisteners 删除所有码流源监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">clearAllStreamSourcesListeners</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">删除所有码流源监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannels_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getavailablevideochannels 获取当前所有可用的码流通道，获取到可用的码流通道后，可以调用startchannel为相应的码流通道设置streamsource并且开启码流传输。除此之外，你也可以使用getavailablevideochannel通过设置视频通道类型来获取码流通道。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getAvailableVideoChannels</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取当前所有可用的码流通道，获取到可用的码流通道后，可以调用startChannel为相应的码流通道设置StreamSource并且开启码流传输。除此之外，你也可以使用getAvailableVideoChannel通过设置视频通道类型来获取码流通道。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannel_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getavailablevideochannel 设置视频通道类型来获取码流通道。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getAvailableVideoChannel</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">设置视频通道类型来获取码流通道。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"class\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Class</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">5</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_streamsource_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"streamsource 码流源信息类。用于获取码流源唯一标示id，码流对应的物理设备类型，物理设备型号，物理设备在飞机上的位置。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">StreamSource</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">码流源信息类。用于获取码流源唯一标示ID，码流对应的物理设备类型，物理设备型号，物理设备在飞机上的位置。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"ivideochannel 码流通道管理类，用于管理视频源，每个码流通道可以设置码流源。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">IVideoChannel</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">码流通道管理类，用于管理视频源，每个码流通道可以设置码流源。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_ivideoframe_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"ivideoframe 帧数据类。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">IVideoFrame</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">帧数据类。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_ivideodecoder_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"ivideodecoder dji码流解码器类。支持yuv输出模式和surface输出模式。你可以通过构造函数设置解码器输出模式\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">IVideoDecoder</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">DJI码流解码器类。支持YUV输出模式和SURFACE输出模式。你可以通过构造函数设置解码器输出模式</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivideostreammanager_streamsourcelistener_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"streamsourcelistener 码流源监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">StreamSourceListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">码流源监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">没有匹配的成员，请尝试更短的关键词。</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablestreamsources\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivideostreammanager_getavailablestreamsources_inline\">getAvailableStreamSources</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablestreamsources_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getAvailableStreamSources</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Nullable</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">StreamSource</span><span class=\"jv-punct\