SDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">clearAllStreamSourcesListeners</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">删除所有码流源监听器。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannels\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannels_inline\">getAvailableVideoChannels</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannels_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getAvailableVideoChannels</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Nullable</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">IVideoChannel</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getAvailableVideoChannels</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取当前所有可用的码流通道，获取到可用的码流通道后，可以调用<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel_startchannel\">startChannel</a></code>为相应的码流通道设置<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_StreamSource.html#ivideostreammanager_streamsource\">StreamSource</a></code>并且开启码流传输。除此之外，你也可以使用<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager.html#ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannel\">getAvailableVideoChannel</a></code>通过设置视频通道类型来获取码流通道。 <br></font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>注意</strong><br><br>第一个码流通道是主码流通道<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel_videochanneltype_primarystreamchannel\">PRIMARY_STREAM_CHANNEL</a></code>。 <br>第二个码流通道（如果有）是副码流通道<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel_videochanneltype_secondarystreamchannel\">SECONDARY_STREAM_CHANNEL</a></code>。 <br>第三个码流通道（如果有）是扩展码流通道<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel_videochanneltype_extendedstreamchannel\">EXTENDED_STREAM_CHANNEL</a></code>。 <br><br></font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\"><b>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IVideoChannel</span></a><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span></code></span></td><td>返回码流通道列表。</td></tr></tbody></table></b></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><b>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannel\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannel_inline\">getAvailableVideoChannel</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannel_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getAvailableVideoChannel</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Nullable</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">IVideoChannel</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getAvailableVideoChannel</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">VideoChannelType</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">type</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">设置视频通道类型来获取码流通道。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>type</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel_videochanneltype\"><span class=\"jv-type\">VideoChannelType</span></a> </code></span></td><td>视频通道类型。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_IVideoChannel.html#ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IVideoChannel</span></a></code></span></td><td>返回视频通道。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<h5 id=\"Related\">Related:</h5>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_streamsource\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">class</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_StreamSource.html\">StreamSource</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc class-inline-doc offline-class-inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_streamsource_inline\" data-class-href=\"IVideoStreamManager_StreamSource.html\" data-class-name=\"StreamSource\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">class</span><h3>StreamSource</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div><figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Deprecated</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><wbr><span class=\"jv-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"jv-class\">StreamSource</span> <span class=\"jv-keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"jv-type\">KeepProguard</span></span></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><font color=\"#666\">码流源信息类。用于获取码流源唯一标示ID，码流对应的物理设备类型，物理设备型号，物理设备在飞机上的位置。</font></p><p></p></div><div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_ivideochannel\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"colo